cancelOutBridgeTransfer.t.sol
├── given recovery mode is off
│  ├── when caller is not the Mechanic
│  │  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
│  └── when caller is the Mechanic
│     ├── given the provided transfer ID does not correspond to a cancellable outgoing transfer in adapter's storage
│     │  └── it should revert with InvalidTransferStatus
│     └── given the provided transfer ID corresponds to a cancellable outgoing transfer in adapter's storage
│        ├── it should decrease the corresponding adapter's token balance by bridge transfer input amount
│        ├── it should increase the machine's token balance by bridge transfer input amount
│        └── it should emit an OutBridgeTransferCancelled event
└── given recovery mode is on
   ├── when caller is not the Security Council
   │  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
   └── when caller is the Security Council
      ├── it should decrease the corresponding adapter's token balance by bridge transfer input amount
      ├── it should increase the machine's token balance by bridge transfer input amount
      └── it should emit an OutBridgeTransferCancelled event
